  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 801.03 “Deed” means any instrument by which the real estate or interest in real estate is sold, granted, assigned, or transferred, as described in RSA 78-B:4.\n\nSource. #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss and moved by #6691, eff 2-21-98 (from Rev 801.02), EXPIRED: 2-21-06\n\nNew. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; ss by #14071, eff 9-10-24",
